{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18213260","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18213260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1821326001:1":{"text":"多了几件礼物……塞勒斯和婕德是毕业了吗？","source_cn":"多了几件礼物……塞勒斯和婕德是毕业了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1CA88320D0CF710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1821326002:1":{"text":"塞勒斯被一户人家领养了，婕德是上周毕业的，她已经可以独当一面了。","source_cn":"塞勒斯被一户人家领养了，婕德是上周毕业的，她已经可以独...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E997482BEB33556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1821326003:1":{"text":"我会把你为他们准备的礼物寄送到新地址，放心吧，塞涅小姐，他们一定能收到。","source_cn":"我会把你为他们准备的礼物寄送到新地址，放心吧，塞涅小姐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCECB0FF8BC7598D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1821326004:1":{"text":"多谢。他们得以开启新的生活篇章，这份礼物也算是份祝福。","source_cn":"多谢。他们得以开启新的生活篇章，这份礼物也算是份祝福。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93D3D3AE2BF6030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1821326005:1":{"text":"你愿意陪孩子们度过最艰难的日子，是我应该感谢你，塞涅小姐。","source_cn":"你愿意陪孩子们度过最艰难的日子，是我应该感谢你，塞涅小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA377A3533A92FAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1821326005":{"text":"你愿意陪孩子们度过最艰难的日子，是我应该感谢你，塞涅小姐。","source_cn":"你愿意陪孩子们度过最艰难的日子，是我应该感谢你，塞涅小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA377A3533A92FAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1821326006:1":{"text":"对，但我是孤儿院的员工。不过，我刚死的时候，确实在孤儿院生活过。","source_cn":"对，但我是孤儿院的员工。不过，我刚死的时候，确实在孤儿...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFF20954B0DAA6DCB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"对，但我是孤儿院的员工。不过，我刚死的时候，确实在孤儿院生活过。","female":"对，但我是孤儿院的员工。不过，我刚死的时候，确实在孤儿院生活过。","variant_male_record_index":"247673","variant_female_record_index":"247674","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1821326008:1":{"text":"我是早逝者，只是外貌还维持着小孩子的模样。这样和刚刚来到诺珐斯的孩童们接触起来比较方便，不会有隔阂。","source_cn":"我是早逝者，只是外貌还维持着小孩子的模样。这样和刚刚来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F992CB134F317D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1821326009:1":{"text":"领主阁下在诺珐斯建立之初就设立了这座孤儿院，专门收留孤身变为亡灵、无人照料的新亡者孩童。","source_cn":"领主阁下在诺珐斯建立之初就设立了这座孤儿院，专门收留孤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD1C99A1BFC0B43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1821326010:0":{"text":"我们会对孩子们进行再教育，提供必要的生活指引，直到他们心智成熟、能够顺利适应诺珐斯的生活——也就是俗称的“毕业”。","source_cn":"我们会对孩子们进行再教育，提供必要的生活指引，直到他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1281EF9D715987FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1821326011:0":{"text":"在这期间，孤儿院会承担一切生活成本。许多重组家庭也会来这里领养孩子，当然啦，他们得经过全方位的审核与调查。","source_cn":"在这期间，孤儿院会承担一切生活成本。许多重组家庭也会来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAC54AB1A7E9DA7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1821326012:0":{"text":"我刚到诺珐斯时，莉栗小姐为我提供了许多当地生活指引。得知她在孤儿院工作后，我主动提议去为孩子们举办慈善表演。","source_cn":"我刚到诺珐斯时，莉栗小姐为我提供了许多当地生活指引。得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DE021233A9AC2BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1821326013:0":{"text":"我死后并未对身份转变感到不适，因为我还能继续登台演出，我和观众的情感链接从未断开。","source_cn":"我死后并未对身份转变感到不适，因为我还能继续登台演出，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5D0644ACB0B7F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1821326014:0":{"text":"但我理解，不是每个人都像我这样幸运——尤其是年幼的孩子。他们尚未建立对世界的认知，就已经被迫跨越了生死边界。","source_cn":"但我理解，不是每个人都像我这样幸运——尤其是年幼的孩子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF86B0178B8CE5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1821326015:0":{"text":"我想，我有义务在这种时刻陪伴在他们的身边。唯有正视并理解死亡的真谛，才能更好地生活。","source_cn":"我想，我有义务在这种时刻陪伴在他们的身边。唯有正视并理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"